ignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/milestones/14","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/milestone/14","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/milestones/14/labels","id":4111869,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDExMTg2OQ==","number":14,"title":"5.0.x","description":"","creator":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":318,"state":"closed","created_at":"2019-03-05T12:38:50Z","updated_at":"2023-06-15T11:50:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2019-06-05T15:00:45Z"},"comments":14,"created_at":"2019-03-08T21:54:46Z","updated_at":"2019-04-01T04:50:15Z","closed_at":"2019-03-27T22:15:54Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nIn version 5.0 of the **info** addon, **Story Source** is breaking if the component is wrapped in `forwardRef`\r\n\r\nThis additionally breaks the parsing of props in **TypeScript** (and maybe JavaScript, have not been able to test).\r\n\r\n**_Here are some collapsable sections for the files in question:_**\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Component</summary>\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\nimport React, { forwardRef } from 'react';\r\n\r\nexport interface TestButtonProps {\r\n  /**\r\n   * Some input prop.\r\n   * @default: \"Default value\"\r\n   */\r\n  someProp?: string;\r\n  /**\r\n   * Some onClick handler prop.\r\n   */\r\n  onClick?: () => void;\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport const TestButton = forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, TestButtonProps>(\r\n  ({ someProp = 'Default value', onClick }, ref) => {\r\n    return (\r\n      <button onClick={onClick} ref={ref}>{someProp}</button>\r\n    );\r\n  },\r\n);\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Version 4.x Story Source <b>(GOOD)</b></summary>\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n<TestButton\r\n  someProp=\"Hello, World!\"\r\n  onClick={onClick}\r\n/>\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Version 5.x Story Source <b>(BAD)</b></summary>\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n<ForwardRef\r\n  someProp=\"Hello, World!\"\r\n  onClick={action}\r\n>\r\n  <button onClick={action}>\r\n    Hello, World!\r\n  </button>\r\n</ForwardRef>\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### To Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Create any component using `forwardRef` in React.\r\n\r\n### Expected behaviour\r\n\r\nShould match up with the result of version `4.x`.\r\n\r\n### System\r\n\r\n - OS: MacOS\r\n - Device: Macbook Pro 2018\r\n - Browser: all\r\n - Framework: React\r\n - Addons: info\r\n - Version: 5.0\r\n- Language: TypeScript\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ndelangen","id":3070389,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzAzODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3070389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndelangen","html_url":"https://github.com/ndelangen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndelangen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndelangen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: